{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30952","headline":"麦穗两岐 · 郑畋","name":"麦穗两岐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣虑忧千亩，嘉苗荐两岐。\n如云方表盛，成穗忽标奇。\n瑞露纵横滴，祥风左右吹。\n讴歌连上苑，化日遍平陂。\n史册书堪重，丹青画更宜。\n愿依连理树，俱作万年枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑畋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}